# DRC-SCALE-3: scalefactor 300 width m1 451, then scalegrid 1 2 and 2 1; and (Q-DRC-1) a second technology with scalefactor 10 area m1 1001 2, then scalegrid 1 2; printrules before and after each rescale.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
drc printrules w_1.txt
scalegrid 1 2
drc printrules w_2.txt
scalegrid 2 1
drc printrules w_3.txt
tech load input/drcarea -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
tech lambda
drc printrules a_1.txt
scalegrid 1 2
drc printrules a_2.txt
drc *halo
